  "releaseNotes": "- **Renamed `ManiaAPI.XmlRpc` to `ManiaAPI.GBXRemote`**. Update package references and namespaces, and replace `XmlRpc..` with their `GBXRemote` equivalents\n- Fixed concurrent calls interleaving writes on the same connection\n- Fixed calls hanging after disconnection and sockets leaking when connection setup fails\n- Fixed GBXRemote 1 calls receiving the response to a cancelled call\n- Fixed `Dispose` throwing `ObjectDisposedException` in calls and callbacks still in progress\n- Fixed malformed callbacks stopping callback processing, invalid payload sizes causing excessive allocations, and integer serialization depending on the current culture\n- Added .NET 11 support",
